MODULE: MembershipAccumulatorAtomicMembershipOnly
TARGET: MembershipAccumulatorAtomic
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: ordinary membership advances while its numeric accumulator retains the prior row
PERTURBS: ReadOrdinary

--- FIND
    /\ counts' = NextCounts(members, counts, 1)
    /\ sums' = NextSums(members, sums, 1)
--- REPLACE
    /\ counts' = counts
    /\ sums' = sums
--- END
